BodyLine AI helps you record body progress from photos and stay focused on your goal silhouette.

• Snap a photo to compare with last time and your ideal  
• See region scores for chest, shoulders, core, and arms  
• Compare Before / After in history  
• Save a timelapse to your photo library  
• No login — export / import your backup  
• Language follows your device, or choose Japanese / English  
• Photos and analysis stay on your device

Build consistency with short check-ins, not complicated gym logs.
